      "description": "Watch KAA Gent vs Club Brugge highlights and goals from Jupiler Pro League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 31, 2026. The atmosphere was thick with anticipation as the teams emerged for this high-stakes Jupiler Pro League encounter. Fans from both sides settled in for a match that promised intensity and tactical intrigue from the very first whistle. Rapid Fire Goals Before the Break On August 31, 2026 , KAA Gent hosted Lommel United in a contest that defined the word unpredictable. The early stages were characterized by physical play, with Kyrell Wilson receiving an early booking. The deadlock was finally broken in the 38th minute when Tiago Araujo set up Josue Vergara , who fired the home side into the lead. The joy in the stands was palpable, but it would prove to be short-lived as the visitors responded almost immediately. Just two minutes later, in the 40th minute, Lommel United found their equalizer. Carlos Forbs turned provider, delivering a clinical ball to Hans Vanaken , who made no mistake in leveling the score. The teams headed into the tunnel at 1-1, setting the stage for a second half that would be dominated by disciplinary drama and a late search for a winner. Discipline Crumbles in a Dramatic Finale The complexion of the match changed drastically in the 70th minute when Carlos Forbs , previously the hero of the equalizer, was shown a straight red card. With Lommel down to ten men, Gent pushed forward, and the introduction of Ibrahima Cisse became the game's defining substitution. Cisse , who had already been booked shortly after coming on, found the back of the net in the 85th minute following an assist from Matties Volckaert . The drama reached a fever pitch in stoppage time. Having scored the decisive goal, Ibrahima Cisse saw red himself in the 94th minute, following heavy protests and a second bookable offense. Despite both teams finishing the match with ten men, Gent managed to hold on to their lead 